#. ja: クエスト『<string $s1>』のバトルを開始します。<br>よろしいですか？<br><br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>※レベルシンク対象コンテンツです。<br>　上限を超えた場合、以下のように自動調整されます。<br>　レベル：<sheet QuestBattle $n2 3><if ($n3 > 0)><br>　アイテムレベル：<num $n3></if></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Den Kampf von „<string $s1>“ beginnen?<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Dieser Inhalt unterliegt einer automatischen Stufenanpassung. Wenn dein Charakter <if ($n3 > 0)>die folgenden Werte<else>den folgenden Wert</if> übersteigt, wird eine entsprechende Anpassung vorgenommen:<br>-  Stufe: <sheet QuestBattle $n2 3><if ($n3 > 0)><br>-  Gegen<shy>stands<shy>stufe: <num $n3></if></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Commencer la bataille de la quête “<string $s1>”<nbsp>?<br><br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>* Cette bataille est sujette à la synchronisation de quête.<br>Si les ca<shy>rac<shy>té<shy>ris<shy>ti<shy>ques de votre personnage dépassent un certain niveau, elles seront ajustées de la façon suivante<nbsp>:<br> Niveau<nbsp>: <sheet QuestBattle $n2 3><if ($n3 > 0)><br> Niveau d'objet moyen<nbsp>: <num $n3></if></ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <string $s1> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <sheet QuestBattle $n2 3> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = QuestBattle, row = number parameter 2, column = 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n3 > 0)><br> Item level: <num $n3></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n3> — a number; value = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
