msgid "Loot Rule: Greed Only"
msgstr "Правило добычи: только «Жадность»"

#. ja: 対象コンテンツ開催期間<br>※開催されるコンテンツは毎日<reset-time 0><if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時に切り替わります。
#. de: Zeitraum<br>※ Der aktuelle Inhalt ändert sich täglich um <reset-time 0><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>:00 Uhr (Erdenzeit).
#. fr: La mission change chaque jour à <reset-time 0><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <reset-time 0> — sets the time placeholders to the next daily or weekly reset; hour = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 >= 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "Addon:102628:0:0"
msgid "Duty Availability<br>※Duty changes every day at <reset-time 0><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> (Earth time)."
msgstr "Доступность подземелья<br>※ Подземелье меняется ежедневно в <reset-time 0><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:00 по времени Земли."

