msgctxt "Addon:102665:0:0"
msgid "Approve <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if>'s application for membership?"
msgstr "Принять заявку на вступление от <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>себя<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if>?"

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>の加入申請を拒否します。<br>相手側に通知を送りますが、<br>よろしいですか？
#. de: Das Beitrittsgesuch von <if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 3><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 3 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> ablehnen?
#. fr: Refuser la candidature <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 9 $gn7 1 1><else><if (9 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 9 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 9 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if><nbsp>? Le postulant rejeté sera prévenu par un message.
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "Addon:102666:0:0"
msgid "Deny <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if>'s application for membership?"
msgstr "Отклонить заявку на вступление от <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>себя<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if>?"

